# The capture deployment needs its application and the shared canonical schemas.
# Documents, intake exports, model inputs and other workspace files stay local.
**
!apps
!apps/capture
!apps/capture/**
!packs
!packs/oil-gas
!packs/oil-gas/schemas
!packs/oil-gas/schemas/**
!packs/oil-gas/tests
!packs/oil-gas/tests/fixtures
!packs/oil-gas/tests/fixtures/**
apps/capture/node_modules
apps/capture/.next
apps/capture/.vercel
apps/capture/test-results
apps/capture/playwright-report
apps/capture/AGENTS.md
apps/capture/CLAUDE.md
apps/capture/.env*
apps/capture/*.tsbuildinfo
